# Ultra-fast delta deploy (LOCKED)

**Gate first:** See `no-deploy-without-ask.mdc` — **do not run any deploy** until the user explicitly asks. This file only defines *how* to deploy after that ask.

**User order:** Deploy **only what changed**. Full 1800-file FTP / whole-repo Hostinger push = **banned** for normal fixes. GitHub/local → Hostinger must stay instant.

## Commands (prefer these)

| Need | Command |
|---|---|
| API PHP only | `npm run deploy:api` or `node scripts/deploy-api-hotfiles.js --target=flowers\|central\|all` |
| UI + API changed | `npm run deploy:fast:flowers` / `deploy:fast:central` / `deploy:fast` |
| Rare full resync | `npm run deploy:all` **only when user explicitly asks full** |

`deploy:fast*` = clean `dist/` + Vite build + **sha1 manifest delta** (parallel hosts). Second run uploads far fewer files.

## Do not

- Re-upload all images/fonts every fix
- Run slow full FTP when delta covers the change
- Push/deploy the entire monorepo “just in case”
- Start a second full deploy while one is running (kill stale first)

## After deploy

Smoke live hosts the user cares about (`giftshop-sa.com`, `mieraf-ksa.com`): health, products, `/admin` stays on login (not bounce to `/`).

## Status

**Ho gaya** / **Baqi** with which target + approx file count uploaded.
